    "detail": "Anan derived the commandments from Scripture by his own reasoning, often more strictly than the rabbis did. Later Karaites revered him as a founder while departing from many of his rulings.",
    "study": "You weigh Anan's rulings against the verses he derived them from.",
    "yeshiva_msg": "has mastered Sefer ha-Mitzvot of Anan at the yeshiva."
   },
